   "lines": [
    "Have been feeling",
    "very heart sick",
    "for Father; when",
    "singing tonight,",
    "we none of us",
    "could sing \"Safe",
    "in the arms of",
    "Jesus\"; we sang",
    "it together on",
    "that terrible Sun-",
    "-day. I read to-",
    "-day at prayers",
    "one of his favour-",
    "-ite chapters — Is. LV.",
    "I can never thank",
    "God sufficiently for",
    "having given me such",
    "a lovely, affectionate family."
   ],
